What does this program print?

```rust
fn main() {
    let mut x = 1;
    let r = loop {
        x *= 3;
        if x > 50 {
            break x - 1;
        }
    };
    println!("{r}");
}
```

What does this program print? Write the four words separated by spaces.

```rust
fn main() {
    for n in [0, 7, 12, 15] {
        let s = match n {
            0 => "zero",
            n if n % 15 == 0 => "fifteen",
            n if n % 3 == 0 => "three",
            _ => "other",
        };
        println!("{s}");
    }
}
```

What does this program print?

```rust
fn main() {
    let mut count = 0;
    'outer: for i in 1..=4 {
        for j in 1..=4 {
            if j > i {
                continue 'outer;
            }
            count += 1;
        }
    }
    println!("{count}");
}
```

